    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. It definitely seems like a more powerful shield for people's rights. I've heard some critics argue that this whole \"substantive\" idea is just making up new rights that aren't actually in the Constitution, though. Do you think those criticisms are valid, or are they just trying to undermine civil liberties?",
